The files d3_format.py and d3_compose.py in this directory are copied from
the vllm-sr/d3-turbo model package (https://huggingface.co/vllm-sr/d3-turbo),
Copyright the d3-turbo authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
They define the byte-exact d3 prompt and answer-code contract. Do not edit
them; upstream changes must be pulled from the model package.

d3_server.py is copied from the same package. It is the reference HTTP contract
(routes, status codes, bearer auth, chunked bodies, media limits). The d3-trt
server reuses it unchanged with an adapter that swaps the backbone runner.
